    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Evaluation Routine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our clients are excited to add our humanoid robots to their companies workforce. Your job is to make sure they are ready for deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect their mechanical integrity, load the appropriate firmware and training modules and assess their behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any malfunction, mechanical or behavioural is to be reported and contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanoid Factory Routine: Inspect hardware, install chips, monitor behaviour and report any malfunctions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Gameplay: Navigate the facility and make use of hiding spaces to avoid being spotted when threatened by hostile robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore: Explore hidden transmits in the server logs uncovering the sinister truth behind the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable AI: Don't let the robots fool you, they might catch you off guard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Evaluation Routine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our clients are excited to add our humanoid robots to their companies workforce. Your job is to make sure they are ready for deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect their mechanical integrity, load the appropriate firmware and training modules and assess their behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any malfunction, mechanical or behavioural is to be reported and contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanoid Factory Routine: Inspect hardware, install chips, monitor behaviour and report any malfunctions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Gameplay: Navigate the facility and make use of hiding spaces to avoid being spotted when threatened by hostile robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore: Explore hidden transmits in the server logs uncovering the sinister truth behind the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable AI: Don't let the robots fool you, they might catch you off guard.</p>",
